    "background_story": "Mabel was a pillar of her community, known for her unwavering commitment to routine and regularity. Every morning, without fail, she would rise at 6:00 AM to tend to her garden, nurturing the flowers and vegetables with precision and care. Her daily schedule was a marvel of consistency, with each hour accounted for: 7:00 AM breakfast, 8:00 AM volunteering at the local library, and 12:00 PM lunch at the same caf\u00e9. Mabel's regularity was a source of comfort to those around her, who relied on her predictability. She was always on time, always prepared, and always willing to lend a helping hand. As the years passed, Mabel's dedication to her routine became a beacon of stability in an ever-changing world, earning her the nickname 'The Clockwork Lady'.",
